    "text": "Maximum possible acceleration of <math><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> block <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c9ecdf6f-12b7-4b06-bb01-7c97ae59b753-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 140px;\" /><br />For <math><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> block not to slide the maximum acceleration of both blocks should be<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3a5d7c56-599f-47a8-bd37-c17b248cc2be-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 133px;\" /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
